<div class="ren-float ren-float--rationale"><p class="ren-float-label">ROUTING RATIONALE</p><p class="ren-float-text">Confidential tenant data, so policy sent this task to an approved frontier model under the data residency rule.</p></div>
<div class="ren-float ren-float--session"><span class="ren-pill ren-pill--light"><span class="ren-dot ren-dot--green"></span>Governed session GS-20418</span><p class="ren-float-meta">Logged automatically · chain intact</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="ren-problems"><div class="ren-container"><h2 class="ren-sr">The Problem</h2><div class="ren-grid-3">
<article class="ren-card"><h3>Shadow AI</h3><p>Staff paste client and patient data into consumer chatbots, with no agreement in place.</p></article>
<article class="ren-card"><h3>Subscription Sprawl</h3><p>You pay for several AI tools and can't see how any of them are used.</p></article>
<article class="ren-card"><h3>No Answer for the Auditor</h3><p>When someone asks what the AI did with that data, nobody can say.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="ren-section" id="how-it-works"><div class="ren-container"><header class="ren-head"><p class="ren-eyebrow">How It Works</p><h2 class="ren-title">Governance That Adds No Work for Your Team</h2><p class="ren-sublede">People pick a mode and describe the task. Policy and routing happen in the background, and the record writes itself.</p></header><div class="ren-grid-3">
<article class="ren-card"><span class="ren-step">01</span><h3>Ask in Plain Language</h3><p>Sign in with your company account. Your role is already set. Choose Chat, Builder or Agent and describe the work.</p><div class="ren-demo"><span class="ren-pill ren-pill--accent"><span class="ren-dot"></span>Chat · Builder · Agent</span><p>Draft a rent-increase notice for Maple Court...</p></div></article>
<article class="ren-card"><span class="ren-step">02</span><h3>Policy Picks the Model</h3><p>Rules by data sensitivity, task type and role run before any model sees the task. You get a plain-language reason.</p><div class="ren-demo"><span class="ren-pill ren-pill--accent"><span class="ren-dot"></span>Policy checked · Confidential</span><p>Approved frontier model</p></div></article>
<article class="ren-card"><span class="ren-step">03</span><h3>The Record Writes Itself</h3><p>Every step lands in a tamper-evident audit trail. Accept the result and the session closes. Nothing to export.</p><div class="ren-demo"><span class="ren-pill ren-pill--accent"><span class="ren-dot"></span>Logged · GS-20418</span><p>Result accepted · no overrides</p></div></article></div></div></section>
<section class="ren-section"><div class="ren-container ren-session-grid"><div><header class="ren-head"><p class="ren-eyebrow">The Governed Session</p><h2 class="ren-title">A Record a Stranger Can Read</h2><p class="ren-sublede">Each task is one governed session: who ran it, on which model, under which policy, with what outcome.</p></header>
<ul class="ren-features"><li>Plain-language summary of what happened and why that model was chosen.</li><li>Step-by-step timeline from request to accepted result.</li><li>Tamper-evident chain so records can be verified later.</li></ul></div>
<article class="ren-card ren-session"><p class="ren-eyebrow">In Plain Language</p><p class="ren-session-summary">Kevin asked for a rent-increase notice. Because it involved confidential tenant data, policy required an approved frontier model. It ran in 4.2 seconds. Kevin accepted it. No overrides.</p>
<ol class="ren-timeline"><li><span class="ren-tdot"></span><div><time>12:44:02</time><strong>Policy Evaluated</strong><span>Data residency matched</span></div></li><li><span class="ren-tdot"></span><div><time>12:44:03</time><strong>Model Executed</strong><span>Approved frontier model · $0.012</span></div></li><li><span class="ren-tdot ren-tdot--green"></span><div><time>12:44:31</time><strong>Accepted by User</strong><span>Sealed · chain intact</span></div></li></ol></article></div></section>
<section class="ren-section"><div class="ren-container"><header class="ren-head"><p class="ren-eyebrow">Capabilities</p><h2 class="ren-title">Everything an Admin Needs, and Nothing Users Notice</h2><p class="ren-sublede">The wedge is governance. The rest makes it usable every day.</p></header><div class="ren-grid-3">
<a class="ren-card ren-card--link" href="https://rengroup.ai/product/routing" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="ren-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span><h3>Routing Under Policy</h3><p>Rules by data sensitivity, task type and role, enforced before a task reaches any model.</p><span class="ren-more">See policy routing ↗</span></a>
<a class="ren-card ren-card--link" href="https://rengroup.ai/product/audit-trail" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="ren-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span><h3>Automatic Audit Trail</h3><p>Every governed task writes an entry. Nobody has to remember to document anything.</p><span class="ren-more">See the audit trail ↗</span></a>
<a class="ren-card ren-card--link" href="https://rengroup.ai/product/admin" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="ren-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span><h3>Admin Oversight</h3><p>One place to see sessions, cost and policy activity, and to change a rule that applies to the next task.</p><span class="ren-more">See the admin dashboard ↗</span></a>
<a class="ren-card ren-card--link" href="https://rengroup.ai/models" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="ren-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span><h3>Hundreds of Models</h3><p>Frontier and open models behind one interface, so you can switch suppliers without retraining your team.</p><span class="ren-more">See supported models ↗</span></a>
<a class="ren-card ren-card--link" href="https://rengroup.ai/security" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="ren-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span><h3>Local and Offline</h3><p>Keep sensitive work on your own machines when policy calls for it.</p><span class="ren-more">See security ↗</span></a>
<a class="ren-card ren-card--link" href="https://rengroup.ai/product/agents" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="ren-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span><h3>Multi-Agent, Side by Side</h3><p>Run several models or agents at once and compare results, with policy applied to each.</p><span class="ren-more">See Agent mode ↗</span></a>
</div></div></section>
<section class="ai-coaching-agents x23sz06" id="coaching"><h2 class="x9oz6bi">AI Coaching Agents for Sales, Leadership and Frontline Teams</h2><p class="xzv18pc">Coaching started as its own product, Vocom AI Coach Hub. It’s now built into RenOS as a set of coaching agents covering recruiting, sales, leadership and frontline teams, so coaching activity sits inside the same governed system as every other agent.</p><div class="xkjv6mq"><div class="xlokxt6 fb"><h3 class="xrfyzq9">Sales Practice</h3><p class="xtdjkpm">Scenario simulation and real-time feedback for pitch, negotiation and service conversations.</p></div><div class="xlokxt6 fb"><h3 class="xrfyzq9">Leadership Development</h3><p class="xtdjkpm">Simulated dialogue and 9-box reporting for succession and promotion readiness.</p></div><div class="xlokxt6 fb"><h3 class="xrfyzq9">Frontline Skill Building</h3><p class="xtdjkpm">Guided coaching with progress tracking for onboarding, support and frontline service roles.</p></div></div><div class="xonijnm"><p class="x8gswed">COACH HUB DEPLOYMENTS</p><div class="xmhhkbk"><div class="xlksddn"><p class="xof3sqp">Finance</p><p class="xydgpk2">50% fewer training hours</p></div><div class="xlksddn"><p class="xof3sqp">Healthcare</p><p class="xydgpk2">60 to 70% lower nursing workload</p></div><div class="xlksddn"><p class="xof3sqp">Retail</p><p class="xydgpk2">3 hours a day reclaimed</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="ren-section"><div class="ren-container"><header class="ren-head"><p class="ren-eyebrow">Who It's For</p><h2 class="ren-title">Teams Where Someone Has to Answer for AI Use</h2><p class="ren-sublede">Multi-user organizations with a compliance duty, client confidentiality, or a growing AI bill.</p></header><ul class="ren-tags">
<li><a href="https://rengroup.ai/industries/dental-groups" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Multi-Location Healthcare</a></li><li><a href="https://rengroup.ai/industries/property-management" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Property Management</a></li><li><a href="https://rengroup.ai/industries/credit-unions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Credit Unions</a></li><li><a href="https://rengroup.ai/industries/professional-services" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Professional Services</a></li><li><a href="https://rengroup.ai/industries/msps" target="_blank" rel="noopener">MSPs and IT Partners</a></li><li><a href="https://rengroup.ai/industries/real-estate" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Real Estate Brokerages</a></li>
